  "description": "*Note: This is a Promotional oneshot.*\n\n\"Was it you... who called me?\"  \nThe black-furred beast looked up with shining yellow eyes.  \n\"It's okay now, You won't get hurt anymore. It'll be alright.\"\n\nYoung Estio was the youngest son in a family of farmers, but everyone hated him. The child who could read the minds of animals and people. As well as...\n\n\"A cursed child.\"\n\nAs his coming-of-age at 19, in search of happiness, Estio's journey begins.",
